    "_doc": "Hardware profile for the LAB FW \u2014 the rehearsal box for a reseed before either real firewall is touched (#93). Its trunk sits on the UNUSED cctv VNet, not vmbrAPPS: the prod firewall trunks on vmbrAPPS, so a lab box carrying VLAN interfaces there would bring up duplicate gateway addresses on production VLANs. Both WAN NICs are on the same isolated VNet with their uplinks off \u2014 a lab firewall never dials an ISP.",
